#: src/blocks/kinetic-before-after/index.js:202
msgid "The reveal itself opens up: a vertical split, an angled diagonal cut, a fade with no edge, and the option to reverse which image is uncovered. Interaction gains hover-to-slide, inertia that lets the divider glide on after release, snapping to the quarter points, and four styles for the intro animation."
