msgid "Three more hover types here - Trace, which draws the border on, plus Shine and Sink - along with bouncy and snappy easing curves, a rotation angle to add to Lift and Scale, a hover text colour in the Paint tab and a separate shadow softness for phones in the Depth tab. The box can also animate in the first time it scrolls into view."
