#: src/blocks/kinetic-magnetic-button/index.js:709
msgid "Detection Range"
msgstr ""

#: src/blocks/kinetic-magnetic-button/index.js:709
msgid "How far the pull reaches in pixels, measured from the centre of the button and added to half its width. Past that distance the button settles back to rest. It does not attract the pointer from across the page: the pull only runs once the pointer is over the button."
msgstr ""

#: src/blocks/kinetic-magnetic-button/index.js:717
msgid "3D Text Parallax"
msgstr ""

#: src/blocks/kinetic-magnetic-button/index.js:717
msgid "The label and icon drift as well, at roughly a third of the travel of the button itself, so the face reads as floating above the surface rather than painted on it."
msgstr ""

#: src/blocks/kinetic-magnetic-button/index.js:724
msgid "Motion on arrival as well: the button can fade, slide up or zoom in the first time it scrolls into view, with a delay of up to two seconds so a row of buttons can land one after another."
